CHAPTER.VERS:
Thus saith the LORD; Behold, I will raise up against Babylon, and against them that dwell in the midst of them that rise up against me, a destroying 
        wind; 

          midst: Heb. heart

Thou my battle axe
weapons of war: for with thee will I break in pieces the nations, and with thee will I destroy kingdoms;
with thee: or, in thee, or, by thee

With thee also will I break in pieces 
        man and woman; and with thee will I break in pieces 
        old and young; and with thee will I break in pieces the young man and the maid;
